tags.description:
We offer a 
        <a href="https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/assets/dash/dist/js/jsonApi.min.js" target="_blank" download="dashClient.min.js">prebuilt js client</a>
        for use with our api. This bundle includes all our schema definitions and can be bootstrapped quickly 
        `let api = new Api.ApiService("our_api_url_here", "your_JWT_here");`  
        Our client has the following public api (resourceTypes match endpoint names - plural kebab-cased strings):  
* __find__(  
resourceType: string,  
id: string|number,  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, page: {size: number, number: number}, filterRelations: bool, sort: string}  
) => Observable
* __findAll__(  
resourceType: string,  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, page: {size: number, number: number}, filterRelations: bool, sort: string}  
) => Observable
* __create__(  
resourceType: string,  
payload: {},  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, filterRelations: bool}  
) => Observable
* __update__(  
resourceType: string,  
payload: {},  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, filterRelations: bool}  
) => Observable
* __delete__(  
resourceType: string,  
id: string|number,  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, filterRelations: bool}  
) => Observable
* __relate__(  
resourceType: string,  
id: string|number,  
relationshipName: string,  
payload: {},  
method: 'POST'|'DELETE'|'PATCH',  
options: {include: string, filter: {}, filterRelations: bool}  
) => Observable
